# Default print destination.
#
# Points at the permanent queue created by cups-queues-service-type, not at
# the temporary queue CUPS auto-creates for the discovered DNS-SD printer.
# Both name the same physical MFC-J1010DW, but only the permanent one is
# visible to Chromium/Brave, so defaulting to it keeps every application
# agreeing on which destination is "the printer".
#
# Note this file is a read-only store symlink: "set as default" in a print
# dialog cannot write here.  Change the default by editing this file and
# running "guix home reconfigure".
Default Brother-MFC-J1010DW
